<title>NORWAY: Statoil to present Q1 result at 1000gmt.</title>
<headline>Statoil to present Q1 result at 1000gmt.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said it would release financial results for the first quarter by 1000gmt on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Statoil's Q1 results will be released by 12 o'clock (1000gmt) today,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
